offenses.35:
Due to Contractor's fault and while the project is on-going it has incurred negative slippage of fifteen percent (15%) or more in accordance with PD 1870;
That after contract time has expired, the project has incurred a negative slippage of ten percent (10%) or more in the completion of the work;
refusal or failure to comply with valid instruction of the procuring entity or failure to proceed expeditiously and without delay despite a written notice by the procuring entity, and
the contractor does not execute Works in accordance with the contract or persistently of flagrantly neglects to carry out its obligations under the contract.
